
<div class="container py-5">
  <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">About FoodieHub</h1>

  <p class="lead">
    FoodieHub is a Ruby on Rails application that helps
    users discover recipes, explore food categories,
    and search recipes by ingredients.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-4">Project Features</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Browse recipes from multiple APIs</li>
    <li>Search recipes by title or ingredient</li>
    <li>Filter recipes by category</li>
    <li>View recipe ingredients and instructions</li>
    <li>Navigate through paginated recipe listings</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="mt-4">Data Sources</h2>

  <p>
    FoodieHub uses TheMealDB and TheCocktailDB
    to provide recipe information.
  </p>

  <%= link_to "Browse Recipes", recipes_path, class: "btn btn-success mt-3" %>
</div>
